# Item art pipeline: the queue/sheet/ledger scratch dir at the repo root.
# Root-anchored on purpose — a bare `art/` also matched `public/art/`,
# which is where `npm run art -- ingest --local` puts images that are
# meant to SHIP with the app, so they were silently left out of git and a
# clean checkout deployed with every local icon broken.
/art/
.env

# Agent worktrees
.claude/worktrees/
